TI  - Multimodal Receptor Architecture for Dietary Sodium Reduction Without Potassium Chloride: Crystal Hydrodynamics, Proton-Heat Cross-Modality, Kokumi CaSR Allostery, and Retronasal Aroma Compensation
AU  - White, Andrew
